sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 🌐 Client Layer
    participant API as 🚪 API Gateway  
    participant Service as ⚡ Service Layer
    participant Storage as 💾 Storage Layer
    participant Infrastructure as 🏗️ Infrastructure Layer

    Note over Client,Infrastructure: High-Level Module Interactions & Coupling

    %% Client to API - Loose Coupling
    Client->>+API: Request (REST/gRPC)
    Note over Client,API: **Loose Coupling**<br/>Protocol abstraction<br/>Multiple client types supported

    %% API to Service - Interface Coupling  
    API->>+Service: Business Logic Call
    Note over API,Service: **Interface Coupling**<br/>Well-defined service contracts<br/>Proto-first communication

    %% Service to Storage - Strategic Coupling
    Service->>+Storage: Data Operations
    Note over Service,Storage: **Strategic Coupling**<br/>Engine abstraction<br/>Dual storage coordination

    %% Storage to Infrastructure - Implementation Coupling
    Storage->>+Infrastructure: Hardware/System Resources
    Note over Storage,Infrastructure: **Implementation Coupling**<br/>Hardware optimization<br/>Resource management

    %% Response Flow - Maintaining Abstraction
    Infrastructure-->>-Storage: Optimized Operations
    Storage-->>-Service: Data Results
    Service-->>-API: Business Results
    API-->>-Client: Protocol Response

